    a. Turn off all bulbs.
    b. Turn off even numbered bulbs.
    c. Turn off odd numbered bulbs.
    d. Turn off bulbs whose index is a multiple of 3.
5. Update the `dp[i][j]` value by the operations that can be performed on this configuration.
