We then decrement n by 4, and enter a loop to continue the clumsy factorial, evaluating the next four operations until n is less than 4. Inside the loop, we do the same operation as before, but subtracting instead of adding the result for each group. We end the loop when n is less than 4.

Finally, we subtract the clumsy factorial of the remaining n (less than 4) from the result and return it. This ensures that the last steps follow the rotation of operations correctly.

