2. Initialize a 2D DP array `dp` where `dp[i][j]` represents the number of ways to form the string `target[0...i]` using the first `j` characters of the strings in `words`.
3. Set the base case for `dp[0][i]` as the count of target character at index 0 in each word of `words`.
