2. Iterate through the array, checking for the presence of the pattern. Create a nested loop over the pattern length(m) and repetitions(k).
3. If at any point a pattern doesn't match, mark patternFound as false and break the inner loop.
4. If a valid pattern is found, return true. Otherwise, continue searching.
5. If no valid pattern is found by the end of the iteration, return false.

