In each iteration of the loop from 2 to max(m, n), we calculate the number of ways to fill the first i columns for both 2-cell and 3-cell components and update the dp and dpf arrays accordingly.

After the loop, the result is the multiplication of the values corresponding to m and n, modulo 10^9 + 7.

