We iterate through every time step from 0 to n-1. If there are any meetings at that time step, we iterate through the people involved in each meeting. If either person involved in the meeting is in the set `secretHolders`, we add both people to the set. As a result, at each time step, we spread the secret instantly to everyone having meetings with the current secret holders. After completing the loop, we return the final `secretHolders` set as a list.

