2. Iterate over each unique number of beans (key) in the count dictionary.
3. For each unique number of beans, calculate the number of beans to remove if all remaining non-empty bags have this number of beans.
4. Accumulate the removal count.
5. Keep track of the minimum removal count.
6. Return the minimum removal count.

